{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into darkness and madness with this VR FPS horror featuring procedural levels. Expect brutal combat, terrifying enemies, and mysterious missions in a world where every step could be your last. Fight monsters, upgrade your skills, and uncover the secrets of a corporation conducting deadly experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide arsenal of weapons - from pistols and rifles to flamethrowers and turrets. Every battle demands precision and quick reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills: speed up firing, increase damage, activate sniper mode, and customize weapons to your needs. Upgrades provide real combat advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprises in Every Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is unique. Procedural generation makes every game truly different. Destroy enemy forces, gather resources, rescue survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, claustrophobic spaces, repulsive monsters, and sudden attacks. Constant fear and tension every minute of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies You Can\u2019t Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xenos, mutants, and other nightmare creatures. Each enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, face final battles with massive bosses that test your skill and endurance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708210?t=1770821234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/f10baced94e1ec1a9db1b0762857dcefe81478ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770821234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/b5c2e5aceeb74ff744b78bab5dc277a97b45e383/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770821234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/b5c2e5aceeb74ff744b78bab5dc277a97b45e383/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770821234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into darkness and madness with this VR FPS horror featuring procedural levels. Expect brutal combat, terrifying enemies, and mysterious missions in a world where every step could be your last. Fight monsters, upgrade your skills, and uncover the secrets of a corporation conducting deadly experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide arsenal of weapons - from pistols and rifles to flamethrowers and turrets. Every battle demands precision and quick reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills: speed up firing, increase damage, activate sniper mode, and customize weapons to your needs. Upgrades provide real combat advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprises in Every Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is unique. Procedural generation makes every game truly different. Destroy enemy forces, gather resources, rescue survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, claustrophobic spaces, repulsive monsters, and sudden attacks. Constant fear and tension every minute of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies You Can\u2019t Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xenos, mutants, and other nightmare creatures. Each enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, face final battles with massive bosses that test your skill and endurance.</p>","developers":["MAKSIMOV VALERII"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/ec9f4ec99945814b7d1701bdc1326583415050ac/header.jpg?t=1770821234","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/233397121/48b4af9aee66e1966dba519f85fd6773c71c9a7d/1769852823/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769854439","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/233397121/48b4af9aee66e1966dba519f85fd6773c71c9a7d/1769852823/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769854439","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/233397121/48b4af9aee66e1966dba519f85fd6773c71c9a7d/1769852823/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769854439","id":257276582,"name":"Xenos surround YOU from all four sides! (front, back, floor, ceiling)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257276582/470eca1f1943c4ed21e0c015c867a24a15ba3cb0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769854439"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765501183","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765501183","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765501183","id":257247810,"name":"2nd trailer of the game Xenolocus","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247810/957ce7b47578d914ae6bd126c7c27641a7468b77/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765501183"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto